{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Gustavo Around the World 由探索青蛙 Gustavo 帶路，玩家在地圖上拖曳角色，逐站認識各國國旗、首都與地理趣味知識，適合正在學習世界地理的兒童與家庭同玩。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-267.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>拖曳青蛙暢遊各國地理</h2>\n<p>遊戲分為四段環球旅程，涵蓋 194 個國家；每到一站，玩家要猜國旗、在地圖上找出國家並收集印章，同時記下首都與趣味知識。小朋友未學會閱讀，也可聽 Gustavo 讀出問題與答案。另設美國 50 州與西班牙、墨西哥、英國、德國的內容，並以問答與 11 種國旗遊戲學習，答對的國家會蓋印在護照上。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-203-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-204-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-205-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-206-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-207-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-208-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Gustavo Around the World</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/gustavo-around-the-world/id6819082047?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:44:14.056420+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T08:32:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:38:02.369622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T08:37:32.923697+00:00","content_hash":"0330fc3dc2a14466c4d2e5bb29bcb4b695109d7c760e62a8079084c2c32e6a8b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}